msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hm? Was it something I said?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mm? ¿Fue algo que dije?」"

msgid "Taiga「No, no. I was just thinking that you＿really are trustworthy.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No, no. Solo pensaba que de verdad＿eres alguien de fiar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't be creepy.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No des miedo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hmph. If it makes you happy, why not＿openly wag your tail?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Jum. Si te hace feliz, ¿por qué no＿mueves la cola abiertamente?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「If I let that make me happy, I'd be the＿one getting goosebumps.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Si eso me pusiera feliz, sería a mí al＿que se le pondría la piel de gallina.」"

msgid "Taiga「......I guess you have a point. Oh well.＿Here, you hold on to this.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Supongo que tienes razón. En＿fin. Toma, quédate con esto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What on earth......? A wooden sword?＿Looks dangerous.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué demonios......? ¿Una espada＿de madera? Se ve peligrosa.」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, you're holding it wrong. Give it＿here, I'll show you how to hold it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, la estás agarrando mal. Dámela,＿te enseñaré cómo sostenerla.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You don't have to! I'm begging you,＿please just behave yourself.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No hace falta! Te lo ruego,＿por favor compórtate.」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm doing this for you! See? When you＿use it, intend on landing a killing blow.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Hago esto por ti! ¿Ves? Cuando＿la uses, ten la intención de＿dar un golpe mortal.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Stop it, I've got a bad feeling about＿this. And I'm not gonna be killing＿anyone.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Para ya, tengo un mal presentimiento＿con esto. Y no voy a matar a nadie.」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't ask questions! Aim for the head＿and take one good swing...... Ah!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No hagas preguntas! Apunta a la cabeza＿y da un buen golpe...... ¡Ah!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wh...... What's wrong?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q...... Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Taiga「I think the gauze on my foot came＿off......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Creo que se me soltó la＿gasa del pie......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's why I told you to behave＿yourself...... Come on, let me see your＿foot again.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Por eso te dije que te comportaras......＿Vamos, déjame ver tu pie otra vez.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why did you bring that wooden sword＿with you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué trajiste esa espada＿de madera contigo?」"

msgid "Taiga「I had this with me on the night that I＿first went to your house. I think it＿could be useful.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Llevaba esto conmigo la noche que＿fui por primera vez a tu casa.＿Creo que podría ser útil.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I dread to think what could have＿happened that night.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Me da pavor pensar qué pudo＿haber pasado esa noche.」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't you think you might remember＿something if you hold onto it? Plus, it's＿great for self-defense.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿No crees que podrías recordar algo＿si la llevas contigo? Además, es genial＿para defensa personal.」"

msgid "Taiga「You should have put it on like this the＿first time around.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Deberías haberla puesto así＿desde la primera vez.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Before you start complaining, say＿thank you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Antes de empezar a quejarte,＿da las gracias.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hm? Who's that?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mm? ¿Quién es?」"

msgid "Taiga「You don't need to get that. It's＿probably StuChi anyway.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No hace falta que atiendas. Seguro＿es StuChi de todos modos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But what if it's not? I should go check,＿just in case......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Pero y si no lo es? Debería ir＿a ver, por si acaso......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Seems it wasn't necessary.＿Definitely Kawashima. Shall we head＿out?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Parece que no hacía falta. Sin＿duda es Kawashima. ¿Salimos ya?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah. My foot feels much better. You＿have my praise, Ryuuji. Now, let's see＿some enthusiasm!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí. Mi pie se siente mucho mejor.＿Tienes mi elogio, Ryuuji. ¡Ahora,＿muestra algo de entusiasmo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't run around too much or the＿gauze will come off again!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No corras demasiado o se te＿volverá a soltar la gasa!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm grateful, but I pray that I never＿need use it for self-defense...... There＿you go.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Te lo agradezco, pero rezo por＿nunca tener que usarla en defensa＿propia...... Listo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It should be harder to dislodge this＿time around.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Debería ser más difícil que＿se suelte esta vez.」"
